      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nHi again! We have submitted a bug report, the original error might've gotten figured out (?) Nobody has really told me but now it seems a different error is coming up, I did try to reply to my support ticket mentioning the new error with info but no one has gotten back to me on it.\n\nWould it be best to make a new new support ticket for this new error? ( My partner is also experiencing the same thing, previous error seems to have stopped but now the newer error is coming up. )",
