  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi! Me ( and my partner ) have been having this error come up quite alot for the past few days. \n\nIt seems to happen at random, for me it's been happening alot when I try to load into worlds but has also happened while already in a world. \n\nI have tried re-installing VRChat, Clearing VRchats caches, and verifying the file integrity. I have also tried some other things from other posts mentioning this error with the same name. I have attached a screenshot of the error pop-up as well as one of the de-bug error files from one of the crashes.",
